error_signature: "openssl/ssl.h: No such file or directory|OPENSSL_INCLUDE_DIR.*empty|pkg_check_modules.*OPENSSL|Select OpenSSL as the SSL backend.*fatal error"
root_cause: "上游 CMake 用 pkg_check_modules(OPENSSL openssl) 探测 OpenSSL 时, pkg-config 只设置复数变量 OPENSSL_INCLUDE_DIRS/OPENSSL_LIBRARIES, 但代码/子模块读取单数变量 OPENSSL_INCLUDE_DIR/OPENSSL_LIBRARIES（FindOpenSSL.cmake 风格）, 单数变量始终为空 → 编译缺头文件。"
rec_approach: "Conan 配方 generate() 中从 self.dependencies['openssl'].cpp_info 显式注入单数变量: tc.variables['OPENSSL_INCLUDE_DIR']=include 目录, 同时注入 OPENSSL_LIBRARIES 指向 lib 目录, 再配合 CMAKE_INCLUDE_PATH/CMAKE_LIBRARY_PATH 供模块查找器使用。"
match_keywords: ["pkg_check_modules", "OPENSSL_INCLUDE_DIR", "openssl/ssl.h", "plural vs singular", "FindOpenSSL"]
error_excerpt: "src/ssl/openssl.c:14:10: fatal error: 'openssl/ssl.h' file not found"
severity: P1
category: build-system, conan, cmake
trigger_tool: conan
applicable_library_types: [cmake, openssl, pkg-config, ssl]
counter_examples: ["上游直接用 find_package(OpenSSL) 且读取复数变量时不适用", "pkg-config 正确配置 PKG_CONFIG_PATH 时单数变量也非标准"]
verification: "libuhttpd 3.14.2: 注入 OPENSSL_INCLUDE_DIR 后 conan create 编译通过, xssl 静态库成功链接 openssl"
limitations: "单数变量名因库而异（SSL_INC/OPENSSL_INCLUDE_DIR 等）, 需按上游实际读取的变量名注入"
last_updated: 2026-09-27
